```plantuml

@startuml
!include https://bitbucket.org/devbox-sante/plantuml/raw/current/themes/theme-devbox-sante.puml

rectangle "Application cliente" as AppCli {
rectangle "Front Application"  as Front #E3F2FD
rectangle "Backend Application\n (optional)" as Backend #E1F5FE
}

rectangle "Proxy eSanté DevBox (IdP)" as Proxy #FFF3E0
rectangle "Pro Santé Connect\n(PSC)" as PSC #F3E5F5


rectangle "Service Espace de confiance\n(DMP, INSi, ePresc, ...)" as TrustService #FBE9E7


skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam noteBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam noteBorderColor transparent
skinparam noteFontColor black

' --- Liaisons principales ---
Front -[#green]-> Backend : 1 - Appel Service EDC\n Bearer Token Keycloak
Backend -[#green]-> Proxy : 2 -  Appel Service EDC\n Bearer Token Keycloak
Proxy -[#green]-> Proxy
note left of Proxy
  3 - Vérification du token
  Vérifie le token Keycloak
  avec sa clé publique
  Récupère la session PSC
end note
Proxy -[#green]-> PSC : 4 - Refresh du token PSC si nécessaire
PSC -[#green,dashed]-> Proxy
Proxy -[#blue]-> TrustService
note right on link
  5 - Appel Api EDC avec Token EDC

end note
TrustService -[#blue,dashed]-> Proxy
Proxy -[#blue,dashed]-> Backend
Backend -[#blue,dashed]-> Front


@enduml
```
